032500* --- 3000-POST-CORRECTION: POST ONE CORRECTION MOVEMENT
032600 3000-POST-CORRECTION.
032700* THIS UTILITY NEVER UPDATES CLR.T_RESERVE. A CORRECTION IS POSTED
032800*   AS
032900* A MOVEMENT ROW ONLY; THE RESERVE ITSELF IS LEFT AS IT IS.
033000     IF WS-ROW-FOUND
