035500             WHEN 0
035600                 ADD 1 TO WS-RESERVE-MOVEMENT-WRITTEN
035700             WHEN +100
035800                 SET WS-ROW-NOT-FOUND TO TRUE
035900             WHEN OTHER
036000                 MOVE '3000-POST-CORRECTION' TO ERR-PARA
036100                 PERFORM 8000-SQL-ERROR
036200         END-EVALUATE
036300     ELSE
036400         ADD 1 TO WS-REJECT-CNT
036500     END-IF
036600     .
